<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<chapter xml:lang="en-US" xml:id="ch-module-1" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Module 1: Choosing Your STEM Professional</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>This section will guide you through selecting a STEM professional for your work to focus on throughout this project.</p>
  </introduction>

  <section xml:id="sec-module-1-intro">
    <title>Introduction</title>
    <p>This section is about framing the choice of STEM professional - should be someone at least adjacent to your major or area of interest.</p>

  </section>

  <section xml:id="sec-module-1-resources">
